writing it.

Usage:
  ob schema rename <obi> <name> <new-name> [flags]

Examples:
  ob schema rename tasks.obi.json Problem Error

Flags:
      --dry-run   show the change without writing it
  -h, --help      help for rename
Remove a named schema. It refuses while anything references it.

Changes <obi> in place. Give - as <obi> to read a document from stdin and
print the result instead, or use --dry-run to see the change without
writing it.

Usage:
