Two concrete gaps have appeared: examples only support add/remove, and `operation rename` rejects an alias that `operation show` accepts. The documented `validate -q` behavior also gives both “conformant” and “undetermined” exit 0, so a script cannot distinguish them. I’m checking the remaining policy and scripting gaps before ranking the surface.
